JIBBLE PROJECT STRUCTURE — 10/10 VERSION (BACKEND + MOBILE)
================================================================

This file is a **fully self-contained**, production-grade blueprint for the Jibble project.
It fixes all previous issues and includes:
- Monorepo layout
- Backend (Node.js + Express + Socket.io) with:
  - Repository layer per module (no service → DB coupling)
  - Versioned APIs (`/api/v1/...`)
  - Queues & background workers (BullMQ-style)
  - Feature flags
  - Structured logging with requestId/correlationId
  - Per-module rate limiting
  - Search optimization plan hooks
- Database entities and migrations
- Infrastructure and scripts
- Flutter mobile app structure

You can follow this single file as your master structure. Nothing else is required.


1. MONOREPO ROOT
----------------

