2. DATABASE TABLE CHECKLIST (NEON POSTGRES)
-------------------------------------------

Minimum tables required:

- users
- profiles
- colleges
- follows
- posts
- stories
- comments
- likes
- categories
- events
- groups
- group_members
- messages
- skills
- match_cards
- notifications
- reports
- roles
- user_roles
- community_components        # which components are enabled per community
- component_templates         # component library definitions


3. BACKEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (.env.example)
-----------------------------------------------

backend/.env.example:

NODE_ENV=
PORT=8080

DATABASE_URL=                 # Neon Postgres URL
REDIS_URL=                    # Redis URL

JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_REGION=
S3_BUCKET_PROFILE=
S3_BUCKET_POSTS=
S3_BUCKET_STORIES=

CLOUDFRONT_URL=
CLIENT_BASE_URL=

BULLMQ_REDIS_URL=             # or QUEUE_REDIS_URL

RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_GLOBAL_MAX=100
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_MAX=10
RATE_LIMIT_CHAT_MAX=600
RATE_LIMIT_POST_MAX=60

FEATURE_FLAGS=                # JSON or comma-separated flags


